==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|glīten}}, from {{inh|de|goh|glītan}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*glīdan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*glīdaną}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*ǵʰleydʰ-}}. Compare {{cog|nds|glieden}}, {{cog|nl|glijden}}, {{cog|en|glide}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈɡlaɪ̯tən/|[ˈɡlaɪ̯tn̩]}}
